#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:225
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_WouldYouLikeToEnter"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the OCEANIC MUSEUM.\p"
"The entrance fee is ¥50.\n"
"Would you like to enter?$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到海洋博物馆。\p"
"入场费是50元。您要入场吗？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:230
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_PleaseEnjoyYourself"
msgid "Please enjoy yourself.$"
msgstr "请尽情参观。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:233
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_NotEnoughMoney"
msgid ""
"Oh? I'm sorry, but you don't seem to\n"
"have enough money.$"
msgstr "哎呀？非常抱歉，您的钱好像不够。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:237
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_CatchUpWithYourGroup"
msgid ""
"Oh? You're with that group that\n"
"went in earlier?\p"
"You're the only one who's late.\n"
"You'd better go catch up to them!$"
msgstr ""
"哦？你和刚才进去的那群人是一起的吗？\p"
"就只有你迟到了。快去追上他们吧！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:243
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_AquaExistForGoodOfAll"
msgid ""
"We, TEAM AQUA, exist for the good\n"
"of all!$"
msgstr "我们海洋队是为了大家的幸福而存在的！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:247
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_OurBossIsntHere"
msgid ""
"We were told to assemble here,\n"
"so we did, but…\p"
"Our BOSS, the linchpin, isn't here.$"
msgstr ""
"上面叫我们在这里集合，\n"
"我们就来了，可是……\p"
"最关键的老大却不在这里。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:252
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_WouldStuffHereMakeMeRich"
msgid ""
"If I ripped off the stuff here,\n"
"would it make me rich?$"
msgstr ""
"要是把这里的东西偷走，\n"
"我会不会发大财呢？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:256
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_CanLearnForNefariousDeeds"
msgid ""
"What I learn here, I can put to use on\n"
"nefarious deeds…$"
msgstr "在这里学到的东西，可以用来干坏事……$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:260
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_RustboroBungled"
msgid ""
"If our goons didn't bungle things\n"
"in RUSTBORO, we wouldn't be here!$"
msgstr ""
"要不是我们的手下在卡那兹市把\n"
"事情搞砸了，我们也用不着来这里！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:264
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_DidntHaveMoney"
msgid ""
"I didn't have ¥50, so it took a long\n"
"time getting by the receptionist.$"
msgstr ""
"我没有50元，\n"
"所以在接待员那里耽搁了好久才进来。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:268
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_LearnAboutSeaForBattling"
msgid ""
"I want to learn about the sea and\n"
"use that knowledge for battling.$"
msgstr ""
"我想学习关于大海的知识，\n"
"再把它运用到对战中。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:272
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_SternIsRoleModel"
msgid ""
"I get all giddy and gooey when\n"
"I see the sea!\p"
"For me, CAPT. STERN is the number\n"
"one role model!$"
msgstr ""
"一看到大海，我就会兴奋得飘飘然！\p"
"对我来说，楠木船长是最棒的榜样！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:278
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_MustBePokemonWeDontKnow"
msgid ""
"The sea is vast without end, and\n"
"infinitely deep…\p"
"There must be many POKéMON that\n"
"we don't know about.$"
msgstr ""
"大海无边无际，又深不见底……\p"
"一定还有很多我们不知道的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:284
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_WantSeaPokemon"
msgid ""
"I want a sea POKéMON.\p"
"I think it would feel cool and nice\n"
"to hug.$"
msgstr ""
"我想要一只海里的宝可梦。\p"
"抱起来一定凉凉的，很舒服。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:289
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_RememberMeTakeThis"
msgid ""
"Aiyeeeh!\n"
"What are you doing here?\p"
"Me? I'm the TEAM AQUA member\n"
"you thumped before, remember?\l"
"Back in RUSTURF TUNNEL?\p"
"Here, take this!\n"
"You have to forgive me!$"
msgstr ""
"哇啊啊啊！你怎么会在这里？\p"
"我？我就是之前被你打败的那个海洋队\n"
"队员啊，还记得吗？在卡绿隧道那次？\p"
"给，拿着这个！你一定要原谅我！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:298
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_HopeINeverSeeYouAgain"
msgid ""
"That TM, it suits you more than it\n"
"does me.\p"
"Hope I never see you again!\n"
"Wahahaha!$"
msgstr ""
"那个招式学习器，比起我，更适合你。\p"
"希望再也别见到你了！哇哈哈哈！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_YouHaveToTakeThis"
msgid ""
"Awww, come on!\n"
"You have to take this and let me go!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，拜托啦！\n"
"你就收下这个，放我走吧！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:308
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_WhirlpoolExperiment"
msgid ""
"A blue fluid is spiraling inside\n"
"a glass vessel.\p"
"“This is an experiment to create a\n"
"WHIRLPOOL artificially using wind.”$"
msgstr ""
"蓝色的液体在玻璃容器里打着旋。\p"
"“这是利用风力人工制造漩涡的实验。”$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:314
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_WaterfallExperiment"
msgid ""
"A red ball is bobbing up and down\n"
"inside a glass vessel.\p"
"“This is an experiment simulating a\n"
"WATERFALL using the ball's buoyancy.”$"
msgstr ""
"红色的球在玻璃容器里上下浮动。\p"
"“这是利用球的浮力模拟瀑布的实验。”$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:320
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_OceanSoilDisplay"
msgid ""
"It's a sample of soil from the ocean\n"
"floor.\p"
"“Over many years, the remains of\n"
"life-forms settle at the bottom of\l"
"the sea, making sedimentary layers.\p"
"“By analyzing these layers, the\n"
"ancient past is revealed.”$"
msgstr ""
"这是海底泥土的样本。\p"
"“经过漫长的岁月，生物的\n"
"遗骸沉积在海底，形成了沉积层。\p"
"“通过分析这些沉积层，\n"
"就能揭开远古的过去。”$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:329
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_BeachSandDisplay"
msgid ""
"It's a sample of beach sand.\p"
"“Stones from mountains are washed\n"
"down by rivers where they are\l"
"chipped and ground down.\p"
"“They are reduced to grains and end\n"
"up as sand on beaches.”$"
msgstr ""
"这是海滩沙子的样本。\p"
"“山上的石头被河水冲下来，\n"
"在途中被磨碎、磨小。\p"
"“它们变成细小的颗粒，\n"
"最后成为海滩上的沙子。”$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:337
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_OceanicMinifact1"
msgid ""
"“OCEANIC MINIFACT 1\n"
"Why is seawater blue?\p"
"“Light is composed of many colors.\p"
"“When light passes through water,\n"
"most kinds of light lose color.\p"
"“However, blue light retains its\n"
"color, making the sea appear blue.”$"
msgstr ""
"“海洋小知识1\n"
"海水为什么是蓝色的？\p"
"“光是由许多种颜色组成的。\p"
"“光穿过水的时候，\n"
"大部分颜色的光都会消失。\p"
"“但是蓝色的光会保留下来，\n"
"所以大海看起来是蓝色的。”$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:346
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_OceanicMinifact2"
msgid ""
"“OCEANIC MINIFACT 2\n"
"Why is the sea salty?\p"
"“Seawater contains dissolved salt in\n"
"the form of sodium and chlorine ions.\p"
"“These ions leech out of rocks\n"
"and are carried out to sea by rain.\p"
"“The concentration of dissolved salt\n"
"makes the sea salty.”$"
msgstr ""
"“海洋小知识2\n"
"大海为什么是咸的？\p"
"“海水中溶解着以钠离子和\n"
"氯离子形式存在的盐。\p"
"“这些离子从岩石中析出，\n"
"被雨水带进大海。\p"
"“溶解的盐的浓度使大海变咸了。”$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:356
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_OceanicMinifact3"
msgid ""
"“OCEANIC MINIFACT 3\n"
"Which is bigger? The sea or land?\p"
"“The sea covers about 70% of\n"
"the planet, and the rest is land.\p"
"“The sea is therefore more than twice\n"
"the size of land.”$"
msgstr ""
"“海洋小知识3\n"
"大海和陆地哪个更大？\p"
"“大海覆盖了地球约70%的面积，\n"
"剩下的是陆地。\p"
"“所以大海的面积是陆地的两倍以上。”$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:364
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_FossilDisplay"
msgid ""
"It's a fossil with wavy ridges on it.\p"
"“Soil on the ocean floor gets scoured\n"
"by the tide.\p"
"“The flowing seawater marks the soil\n"
"with small ridges and valleys.\p"
"“If this soil becomes fossilized, it is\n"
"called a ripple mark.”$"
msgstr ""
"这是一块带有波浪状纹路的化石。\p"
"“海底的泥土会被潮水冲刷。\p"
"“流动的海水会在\n"
"泥土上留下细小的起伏。\p"
"“这样的泥土变成化石后，\n"
"就叫做波痕。”$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F/scripts.inc:373
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_DepthMeasuringMachine"
msgid ""
"A strange machine is rotating under\n"
"a glass dome.\p"
"Maybe it's for measuring the depth\n"
"of something…$"
msgstr ""
"玻璃罩下面有一台奇怪的机器在转动。\p"
"也许是用来测量某种东西的深度的……$"
